dsmr-email-encabulator (1.0-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Initial release. Metapackage for the DSMR qmail/vpopmail/dovecot stack.
  * Depends on: fehqlibs-dev, ucspi-ssl, qmail-uids-gids, qmail, libsrs2,
    vpopmail, dovecot-core, dovecot-imapd, dovecot-mysql, dovecot-vpopmail.
  * Includes DEVLOG.org (development log and Sagredo vs. DSMR comparison),
    per-package README.dsmr documentation, and the dsmr-verify validation
    script.

